{
    "_comment": "Road cards for the Wend valley floor (MAP-6, API-43): the river road from the Millbeck bridge to Saltmouth and the mill lane. Our own text, CC-BY-4.0, credit 'nat20-table contributors'. Variant rule (D2): the road event deck is ours, not the SRD's. Checks use the SRD DC ladder; fights use SRD 5.2.1 stat blocks. Text the players read never names a DC, a number of hit points or a stat block. Faces of the Road (MAP-10): the peddler moved up to the slopes, so his news comes before the bridge.",
    "cards": [
        {
            "id": "rutted_road",
            "zone": "lowland",
            "target": "caravan",
            "text": "Last week's rain has turned the river road to soup. The wagon lurches, a wheel sinks to the hub, and the near horse refuses to pull.",
            "owner_pick": "unload",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "id": "push",
                    "text": "Put your shoulders to the wheel and heave.",
                    "effects": [
                        {
                            "do": "check",
                            "who": "blades",
                            "ability": "strength",
                            "skill": "athletics",
                            "dc": 10,
                            "success": [
                                {"do": "delay", "minutes": 20}
                            ],
                            "failure": [
                                {"do": "delay", "minutes": 90}
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "unload",
                    "text": "Unload the heaviest sacks, roll the wagon free, and load them again.",
                    "effects": [
                        {"do": "delay", "minutes": 60}
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "stray_dog",
            "zone": "lowland",
            "target": "blades",
            "text": "A lean sheepdog trots out of a hedge and falls in beside the wagon, as if it had been hired too.",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "id": "feed",
                    "text": "Toss it a crust and let it come along.",
                    "effects": [
                        {"do": "cargo", "good": "rations", "change": -1},
                        {"do": "remember", "deed": "fed_gwyns_dog"}
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "shoo",
                    "text": "Send it home.",
                    "effects": [
                        {"do": "remember", "deed": "sent_the_dog_home"}
                    ]
                }
            ],
            "note": "Gwyn's sheepdog from the Highsteads, gone after her strays; Gwyn wants it back. It answers to a whistle nobody at the table knows."
        },
        {
            "id": "river_mist",
            "zone": "lowland",
            "when": "night",
            "target": "blades",
            "text": "Mist climbs off the river after dark and the fire spits. Something is moving near the wagon, or nothing is.",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "id": "watch",
                    "text": "Keep a sharp watch by the wagon.",
                    "effects": [
                        {
                            "do": "check",
                            "who": "blades",
                            "ability": "wisdom",
                            "skill": "perception",
                            "dc": 10,
                            "failure": [
                                {"do": "cargo", "good": "rations", "change": -2}
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "sleep",
                    "text": "Sleep.",
                    "effects": [
                        {"do": "cargo", "good": "rations", "change": -2}
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "charm",
                    "text": "Sleep with the bog-wife's charm by the fire.",
                    "if": "sedge_charm",
                    "effects": [
                        {"do": "remember", "deed": "slept_under_sedges_charm"}
                    ]
                }
            ],
            "note": "Nothing is out there, or something small and hungry is; the DM never says which. Sedge's charm, if the Blades have it, is the one thing on this road that makes Maren sleep."
        },
